desc(
	mode: "struct"
	language: "java"
	title: "Struct scan: Java setTrustAllHosts true"
	title_zh: "结构扫描：Java setTrustAllHosts true"
	type: vuln
	level: high
	rule_id: "struct-java-trust-all-hosts"
	risk: "certificate-validation"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
检测到 setTrustAllHosts(true)，等于关闭邮件/TLS 主机校验。

### 风险类型
certificate-validation

### 影响
该用法属于已知危险 API 或弱密码学配置，可能被用于绕过校验、执行代码或泄露机密。

### 检测方式
结构扫描在编译单元内匹配真实调用，而不是注释或字符串字面量。
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
保持默认主机校验，不要信任全部主机。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://M.java": <<<POS
class M {
  void bad() { setTrustAllHosts(true); }
  void setTrustAllHosts(boolean v) {}
}

POS
	"safefile://S.java": <<<NEG
class S { void ok() { System.out.println("verify-host"); } }

NEG
)

setTrustAllHosts(*?{have: true}) as $call
alert $call for {
	level: "high",
	title: "Struct scan: Java setTrustAllHosts true",
	title_zh: "结构扫描：Java setTrustAllHosts true",
	message: "结构扫描：Java setTrustAllHosts true",
	risk: "certificate-validation",
}
